PAL16L8
SNESDOP2
Dopple Board Arbitration PAL 8/16 bit
Phil Torre,Utopia Engineering, Seattle

HCE HWE HOE TCE TWE0 TWE1 TOE WHO WP GND
TCRSEL RAMCE HADDR TADDR HDATA TDATA R/W RAMWE RAMOE VCC

IF (VCC) /HADDR =
	 /HCE * WHO

IF (VCC) /HDATA =
	 /HCE * /HOE * WHO +
	 /HCE * /HWE * WHO

IF (VCC) /TADDR =
	 /WHO

IF (VCC) /TDATA =
	 /TCE * /TOE * /WHO +
	 /TCE * /TWE0 * /WHO +
	 /TCE * /TWE0 * /TCRSEL

IF (VCC) /R/W =
	/HCE * /HWE * WHO +
	/TCE * /TWE0 * /WHO +
	/TCE * /TWE0 * /TCRSEL

IF (VCC) /RAMWE =
	 /HCE * /HWE * WHO +
	 /TCE * /TWE0 * /WHO +
	 /TCE * /TWE0 * /TCRSEL

IF (VCC) /RAMCE =
	 /HCE * WHO +
	 /TCE * /WHO

IF (VCC) /RAMOE =
	 /HCE * /HOE * WHO +
	 /TOE * /WHO


END
